,"poem":1},{"text":"“यो र त्यो त्यहीँ जन्मेका थिए,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"अनि सर्वोच्‍च परमेश्‍वरले नै त्यसलाई स्थापना गर्नुहुनेछ।”","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"याहवेहले जाति-जातिहरूका नाम दर्ता-पुस्तकमा लेख्नुहुनेछ:","poem":1},{"text":"“यसको जन्म सियोनमा भएको हो।” सेला","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"सङ्गीत बजाउँदा तिनीहरूले गाउनेछन्:","poem":1},{"text":"“मेरा सबै आशिष्‌का मूलहरू तँमा नै छन्।”","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":74,"caller":"+","text":"इजिप्टको कवितात्मक नाम हो","reference":{"chapter":87,"verse":4}},{"noteId":75,"caller":"+","text":"अर्थात्, नील नदीको माथिल्‍लो क्षेत्रको भू-भाग","reference":{"chapter":87,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/npi_ncb/PSA/87.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/npi_ncb/PSA/88.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/npi_ncb/PSA/86.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}